# The application's own domain: the Android app's own page, and the chat's
# functionality the app talks to (api/ and media.php, one-line loaders of the
# chat's own files). What people SEE here is the application's page - the
# website chat's pages are not served from this domain (owner, 19 Sep 2026:
# "application ki UI/UX same rahegi, sirf functionality chat jaisi").
DirectoryIndex index.html

# The download page's address given out earlier the same day.
RedirectMatch 302 ^/app/?$ /
